Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?agent=5Ftasks=5Fpanel:=20rows=20carry=20the=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?asks=20card's=20eye,=20=E2=86=91=20and=20=E2=86=93,=20and=20pre?=
